author: codex-astra
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce and isolate package-install cost with synthetic packed consumers; retain the existing deadlines and assertions; document comparison with the hosted matrix.
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T13:59:53.518Z",codex-astra,"A later full focused rerun completed successfully through pm test: import-projection 6/6, including the packed npm/native Bun consumer, with unchanged 45-second child and 600-second test deadlines. No installation or timeout implementation was changed to obtain this pass. Earlier baseline and repaired timeouts remain valid evidence of an intermittent shared-host validation limit; no definitive resource/registry root cause is claimed."
